Before you start, you need:

- **An API key:** [Create an API key](/guides/getting-started#4-create-an-api-key) with the “merchant terminal” role, as described in the Getting Started guide. A “merchant terminal” key can create, cancel, void and refund Payment Requests on behalf of merchants.
- **A Merchant Config ID:** Each Payment Request must be created with the `configId` of the Merchant's [Merchant Config](/api/merchant-configs), which sets the payment methods the merchant accepts. Centrapay will provide you with this ID.

> You are responsible for the safety of your API keys.
